{
 "encounter_id": "00897",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Morning, Mrs Calloway. Is it still raining out there? I've been in since seven and haven't looked. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Pouring. And the car park is a lottery. Never mind that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right, what brings you in today? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's probably nothing. I'm fifty and I get these hot flushes. I wouldn't be here, but my daughter said it's silly to put up with it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How often?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Five or six times a day. Started about eight months ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And at night?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Night sweats, yes. I have to change the T-shirt, once or twice a night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How's your mood?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit short-tempered. The staff would tell you. I'm the head teacher, I'm not supposed to snap."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any weight loss?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, if anything I've put it on."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any lumps in the breasts?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No lumps. I check."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you take at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Levothyroxine, 100 micrograms, once a day. Atorvastatin, 20 mg, at night. Vitamin D, 1000 units, once a day. And ibuprofen, 200 mg, when my knees are bad."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No allergies."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Underactive thyroid, high cholesterol, and migraines."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Appendix out, in 2002."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "When did your mother go through the menopause?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Early, at forty-five."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Never."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Drink?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two glasses of wine, most evenings."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exercise?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I walk the dog, forty minutes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And work, you said head teacher?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, a primary school."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me take your numbers. Pulse 74, blood pressure 128 over 80, temperature 36.7, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 14, and weight 72 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's more than last year. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A couple of kilos. Let me listen to your heart.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Heart sounds are normal, and your thyroid feels normal in size, no lumps."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your heart, palpitations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your waterworks?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing. It's all normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your symptoms sound like the perimenopause, I'd say, but I can't rule out your thyroid dose being off."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it the thyroid? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Possibly. I'd like to arrange blood tests for your thyroid and hormone levels, and a blood count."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And since your mother had an early menopause, I'd like to arrange a bone density scan."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. And what about treatment? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "We'll talk about the options once the results are back. Until then, keep cool at night, and cut the wine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll try, though the wine is the hard part. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in six weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Six weeks. Thank you. ~"
  }
 ],
